  _id: 14041211
  _key: DIALOGUE_SERAPHINE_NODE_Q2_OFFER
  _displayName: 
  _description: 
  _speakerName: Seraphine
  _dialogueText: 'Aurelian remains bound to the Eastern Altar, beyond these crossroads.

    The
    sacred lanterns there still hold a fragment of the First Flame''s power. As in
    the Forgotten Sanctum, igniting enough of them will break the seal and summon
    the guardian within.

    But Aurelian is no ordinary foe.

    I have watched
    over these crossroads for so long, waiting for someone capable of facing him.
    You have already proven your strength in the Forgotten Sanctum.

    If you choose
    to confront my brother, I will not ask you to face him alone.

    Call upon
    me when you stand before him, and I shall answer.

    Will you help me bring
    an end to his suffering?'
  _choices:
  - _choiceText: I'll confront Aurelian.
